{"id": 11765, "title": "Ask for sick leave", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK4"], "slug": "ask-for-sick-leave", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/11765_ask-for-sick-leave.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["最近，王先生因为牙齿痛，预约了两天的牙科检查和治疗，还跟公司请了带薪病假。后来，牙科诊所因为安全检查的原因取消了王先生第一天的预约，而王先生自己把第二天的预约也取消了。虽然牙科预约都取消了，王先生却没有向公司申请取消病假，而是去了香港旅游，还在微信分享自己的旅游照片。公司发现了他在微信的旅游照片，要求他提供这两天的看病记录。因为王先生没有办法提供，公司认为他严重违反了公司的规定，把他开除了。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["最近，王先生因為牙齒痛，預約了兩天的牙科檢查和治療，還跟公司請了帶薪病假。後來，牙科診所因為安全檢查的原因取消了王先生第一天的預約，而王先生自己把第二天的預約也取消了。雖然牙科預約都取消了，王先生卻沒有向公司申請取消病假，而是去了香港旅遊，還在微信分享自己的旅遊照片。公司發現了他在微信的旅遊照片，要求他提供這兩天的看病記錄。因為王先生沒有辦法提供，公司認為他嚴重違反了公司的規定，把他開除了。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["zuì jìn， Wáng xiān sheng yīn wèi yá chǐ tòng， yù yuē le liǎng tiān de yá kē jiǎn chá hé zhì liáo， hái gēn gōng sī qǐng le dài xīn bìng jià。 hòu lái， yá kē zhěn suǒ yīn wèi ān quán jiǎn chá de yuán yīn qǔ xiāo le Wáng xiān sheng dì yī tiān de yù yuē， ér Wáng xiān sheng zì jǐ bǎ dì èr tiān de yù yuē yě qǔ xiāo le。 suī rán yá kē yù yuē dōu qǔ xiāo le， Wáng xiān sheng què méi yǒu xiàng gōng sī shēn qǐng qǔ xiāo bìng jià， ér shì qù le Xiāng gǎng lǚ yóu， hái zài Wēi xìn fēn xiǎng zì jǐ de lǚ yóu zhào piàn。 gōng sī fā xiàn le tā zài Wēi xìn de lǚ yóu zhào piàn， yāo qiú tā tí gōng zhè liǎng tiān de kàn bìng jì lù。 yīn wèi Wáng xiān sheng méi yǒu bàn fǎ tí gōng， gōng sī rèn wéi tā yán zhòng wéi fǎn le gōng sī de guī dìng， bǎ tā kāi chú le。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Recently, Mr. Wang made an appointment for two days of dental examination and treatment due to tooth pain, and also requested paid sick leave from the company. Later, the dental clinic canceled Mr. Wang’s appointment on the first day due to safety inspection, and Mr. Wang himself also canceled the appointment on the second day. Although all dental appointments were cancelled, Mr. Wang did not apply to the company to cancel his sick leave. Instead, he traveled to Hong Kong and shared his travel photos on WeChat. The company discovered his travel photos on WeChat and asked him to provide his medical records for the past two days. Because Mr. Wang had no way to provide it, the company believed that he had seriously violated the company's regulations and fired him."], "english_full": "Recently, Mr. Wang made an appointment for two days of dental examination and treatment due to tooth pain, and also requested paid sick leave from the company. Later, the dental clinic canceled Mr. Wang’s appointment on the first day due to safety inspection, and Mr. Wang himself also canceled the appointment on the second day. Although all dental appointments were cancelled, Mr. Wang did not apply to the company to cancel his sick leave. Instead, he traveled to Hong Kong and shared his travel photos on WeChat. The company discovered his travel photos on WeChat and asked him to provide his medical records for the past two days. Because Mr. Wang had no way to provide it, the company believed that he had seriously violated the company's regulations and fired him.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuì jìn\" data-defn=\"recently\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">最近</span><span class=\"tr\">最近</span><rt>zuì jìn</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Wáng\" data-defn=\"surname Wang\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">王</span><span class=\"tr\">王</span><rt>Wáng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiān sheng\" data-defn=\"teacher / gentleman; sir; mister (Mr.) / husband / (dialect) doctor\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">先生</span><span class=\"tr\">先生</span><rt>xiān sheng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yīn wèi\" data-defn=\"because; owing to; on account of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">因为</span><span class=\"tr\">因為</span><rt>yīn wèi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yá chǐ\" data-defn=\"tooth / dental\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">牙齿</span><span class=\"tr\">牙齒</span><rt>yá chǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tòng\" data-defn=\"ache / pain / sorrow\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4(7-9)\"><span class=\"si\">痛</span><span class=\"tr\">痛</span><rt>tòng</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yù yuē\" data-defn=\"to book / to make an appointment\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">预约</span><span class=\"tr\">預約</span><rt>yù yuē</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"liǎng\" data-defn=\"two / both / some / a few\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tiān\" data-defn=\"day\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yá\" data-defn=\"tooth / ivory\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">牙</span><span class=\"tr\">牙</span><rt>yá</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kē\" data-defn=\"branch of study / administrative section / division / field / branch / stage directions / family (taxonomy) / rules / laws\" data-hsk=\"HSK 6\"><span class=\"si\">科</span><span class=\"tr\">科</span><rt>kē</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiǎn chá\" data-defn=\"inspection\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">检查</span><span class=\"tr\">檢查</span><rt>jiǎn chá</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hé\" data-defn=\"and; together with\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhì liáo\" data-defn=\"medical treatme